OSVplat patch for LichtFeld-Studio 3067e9e0 (applied by scripts/setup_lichtfeld.sh).
Intended for upstream; drop it once LichtFeld has the flag.

--opacity-reg: the opacity regularizer weight (opacity_reg), a Float binding
like --max-screen-share, recorded as an explicit override like every other
optimisation flag. Until now it could only be set through --config, which
replaces the whole optimisation parameter set. MRNF's default stays 0.003;
the flag changes nothing unless given.

Why: LichtFeld #3124 (after this pin) turns MRNF's opacity_reg to 0, measuring
24.92 -> 25.73 dB PSNR on a 7,494-view capture where each surface is seen from
few cameras; OSVplat's 360 walks are that kind of capture. This flag lets the
pinned trainer be compared with and without it on the same build.

